1.Master components
   - kube-apiserver : The main server that manages communication between all the parts of k8s and lets you control the cluster 
   - etcd : A database that stores all the info. about your k8s cluster
   - kube-scheduler : Decides which machine(nodes) should run a new pod
   - kube-controller manager :- Keeps everything in the cluster working as expected by running controller.(like deployment have to 3 pods)

2.Node components
   - Kubelet : make sure the container in a pod are running properly on a node.
   - kube proxy : Manages network connnections so pods and service can talk to each other.
   - container runtime(eg. docker, containerd) :Run the container on your machine
